00:24:45,950 --> 00:24:47,070
Ain't better!

266
00:24:48,070 --> 00:24:49,670
I know that guy!

267
00:24:50,250 --> 00:24:51,080
Wait!

268
00:24:51,163 --> 00:24:51,993
I know him too!

269
00:24:52,076 --> 00:24:54,068
He killed the magistrate, didn't he?

270
00:25:06,910 --> 00:25:08,790
You wanna fight about it?

271
00:25:15,230 --> 00:25:17,950
Don't tell me he's allies with that sumo!

272
00:25:22,650 --> 00:25:23,480
Hey!

273
00:25:24,990 --> 00:25:27,510
We want to fight the boss of this town!

274
00:25:51,310 --> 00:25:53,790
Tell them we're here to save Tama!
